{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>Calculate scores based on tile patterns and bonuses after each winning hand, using &quot;Blood River&quot; rules. Play until reaching the target score or exhausting draw attempts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progression:</strong><br>After clearing Chengdu, unlock another city. Conquer each city to gradually illuminate the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic Mahjong rules\u2014only winning hands score. Rogue-like mechanics ensure unique runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock 100 global cities, each with distinct rules and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Higher difficulty clears expand a city's influence zone, allowing free unlocks within it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and upgrade characters with unique skills to test your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip artifacts to enhance characters' power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attach effects to individual tiles for deeper customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade tile patterns to boost their potency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Planned Updates:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New character designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New artifact designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New city mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New challenge tile decks</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3641990?t=1745432601","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641990/2ed28b847b37c56ee7d9ce2ecb718615c9a5df82/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745432601","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641990/096491a966b05e5c0c7e9ded53c4e2f77a54d3